VWe share your information (including Personal Information and Traffic Data) with our business partners who assist us by performing services (such as hosting, billing, fulfillment, or data storage and security) related to our operation of the Services and/or by making certain Interactive Tools available to our users.
p11
I1
sVThe Installed Tools may collect and transmit information from your computer system solely relating to use of the Installed Tools and for the purpose of providing you the relevant Services, for example, by informing Everseat when a user is logged on and available to receive update or alert notices.
p12
I1
sVThis information is generally used to help us deliver the most relevant information to you.
p13
I1
sVIf we associate location information with other Personal Information, this Privacy Policy governs how we would use that information too.
p14
I1
sg3
I2
sVWe may use your information, including Personal Information, to send you offers, promotional materials, and marketing information about resources or vendors that may be of interest to you, or about Everseat\u2019s Services or other marketing purposes of Everseat.
p15
I1
sVIn addition, we share certain categories of information we collect from you in the ways described in this Privacy Policy, including as described below:
p16
I1
sVIf we learn that we have collected personal information from a child under age 18, we will delete that information as quickly as possible.
p17
I1
sVWe store all Traffic Data indefinitely, even after \u201cdeletion,\u201d and may archive such information elsewhere.
p18
I1
sVWe may transfer information about you to another company in connection with a merger, sale or acquisition by or of Everseat, in which case such company may continue to use your information as set forth in this Privacy Policy.
p19
I1
sVWe collect the following types of information:
p20
I1
sVWe store all Personal Information until you request that we modify or delete it, in which case we may still retain certain Personal Information as described in Section 15 below.
p21
I1
sVWe use the information we get from Google Analytics only to improve our Site and Services.
p22
I1
sVWe may also collect non-personal information from your mobile device if you have downloaded our mobile application.
p23
I1
sVOnce we disclose some of your Personal Information to third parties, we cannot access that Personal Information any longer and cannot force the deletion or modification of any such information by the parties to whom we have made those disclosures (including Vendors).
p24
I1
sVWe may share your contact data with our subcontractors to enable them to send you Everseat promotional materials.
p25
I1
sVEverseat does not collect Personal Information about the persons with whom you share your link until the persons click the link and engage directly with Everseat.
p26
I1
sVWhen you book an appointment using the Service, Everseat will share your relevant Personal Information with the Vendor you have selected to confirm and validate the availability of the appointment and to facilitate the direct communication between you and the Vendor regarding your booking.
p27
I1
sg4
I1
sVWe may use your information, including Personal Information, to administer your account, process payments, verify your identity as a registered user, and provide you with the Services and customer support, including, without limitation, to transmit appointment reservations to the Vendor and to contact consumers with appointment reminders.
p28
I1
sVThese subcontractors will only use your contact data to send you Everseat promotional materials.
p29
I1
sVIf you wish to refer friends to Everseat, we provide you with a unique referral link, which you can share directly with others via email, social media websites, or other communication methods.
p30
I1
sVAdditionally, if the settings on your location-aware device allow us to receive mobile location information, we will collect that automatically.
p31
I1
sVEverseat may use your Personal Information to create de-identified information by removing the information that personally identifies you from the Personal Information otherwise collected.
p32
I1
sVGoogle Analytics collects only the IP address assigned to you on the date you visit the Site, rather than your name or other personally identifying information.
p33
I1
sVEverseat may use such de- identified information and the other anonymous information and statistical information derived from your use of the Services, such as usage patterns and Traffic Data, without restriction.
p34
I1
sVThe payment provider may store your credit card information for future use on the Site; provided that your CVV number will not be stored and must be re-entered for each credit card transaction.
p35
I1
sVEverseat may use the Traffic Data to improve the Site and make other features and services available to you, including, but not limited to, improved functionality of software and the Internet-specific Services.
p36
I1
sVWe may use your information, including Personal Information, to customize and tailor your experience with the Services, to improve the quality of the Site and Services, and to communicate with you, using emails, text messages, or other communications methods.
